# Daisy Bell — HAL 9000 style.
#
# A .song file has two header lines and then a lyrics block.
#   midi:      relative path to a MIDI melody file
#   transpose: semitones to shift (negative = lower)
#   intro:     optional spoken intro in S&S mix voice
#   lyrics:    whitespace-separated syllables, one per MIDI note
#
# Any MIDI + any syllable list works. This is the reusable format.

midi: daisy.mid
transpose: -12
intro: HELLO WORLD

lyrics:
  DAI SY DAI SY  GIVE ME YOUR AN SWER DO
  IM HALF CRA ZY  ALL FOR THE LOVE OF YOU
  IT WONT BE A STY LISH MAR RIAGE
  I CANT AF FORD A CAR RIAGE
  BUT YOULL LOOK SWEET U PON THE SEAT
  OF A BI CY CLE BUILT FOR TWO
